{"about_the_game":"Twos hands two guns!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPistol Dancer is a shoot'em up style rhythmic FPS. Initially, it's a home-collaboration kind of project developed for my daughter to get her interested in VR but it's gradually evolved into a casual/party game that many of us enjoyed with.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPress the trigger alongside music beats to unleash devastating power to the enemies.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYour enemies are little virus bits trying to reach the heart, and you are the last line of defence!","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1274730?t=1600693180","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1274730/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1600693180","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1274730/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1600693180","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1274730/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1600693180","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"Twos hands two guns!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPistol Dancer is a shoot'em up style rhythmic FPS. Initially, it's a home-collaboration kind of project developed for my daughter to get her interested in VR but it's gradually evolved into a casual/party game that many of us enjoyed with.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPress the trigger alongside music beats to unleash devastating power to the enemies.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYour enemies are little virus bits trying to reach the heart, and you are the last line of defence!","developers":["Yang Liu"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1274730/header.jpg?t=1600693180","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</